{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cf318850-dfa7-8a6e-80e6-dfd3e4ccde05",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T12:31:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Deirdre Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:29:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:29:11-05:00",
      "duration": 38,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise, this is Deirdre Reardon, I'm calling because the streetlights on our whole block went out, like all of them, last night, I noticed around six when I got home and it was pitch black out there and it was still dark when I got up this morning, so it's not just a flicker or one bulb, it's the entire stretch of the street, and I think it might be the pole at the corner because there's a box or something on it, so I'd like somebody to send a crew to check the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:29:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that, that's no fun in the dark. What's the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:29:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 363 Malbone Road, in the North End. Sorry, hang on, I'm writing a grocery list while I talk, so, eggs, um, okay. Yes, 363 Malbone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:30:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. And when you say the whole block, about how many lights are you talking about? Any of them still on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:30:15-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "None. I can see maybe four from my front window and all four were off last night. The ones on the next street over, the cross street, those were on, so it's just ours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:30:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Is there any wire down, or anything sparking on the pole, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing like that, nothing hanging down, it just looks like a regular pole. It's just the lights are dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:30:45-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Then I'll put in a work order for a crew to look at the pole and the circuit on Malbone Road. Sometimes the utility company owns the pole, so they may have to coordinate, but we'll get it looked at. Should be within a few days, depending on what they find."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine. Do you need a number for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, in case they need to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:31:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:31:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0191, perfect. And it's Deirdre, D-E-I-R-D-R-E?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:31:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, and Reardon, R-E-A-R-D-O-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:31:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. You're all set, Deirdre. If any lights come back on or it gets worse, call us back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:31:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Denise. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:31:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
